msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"This is so good! It's been so long since I had yakiniku!\r\n"
"Even though I'm in my twenties, I'm still stuck working\r\n"
"part-time, so there's no way I could afford it otherwise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"(This doesn't seem like the girl Nami's father was\r\n"
"looking for.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Question for ya. Would you happen to know a girl named Nami?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"She ran away from home not long ago and came to Kamurocho.\r\n"
"I think she might be working at your telephone club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Oh, you must not understand how these things work!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"The girls working for telephone clubs just take calls from\r\n"
"the club, so we've never actually met one another!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "That makes sense."
msgstr "Ha senso."

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Oh, but I might know that girl!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Huh? Really?"
msgstr "Eh? Davvero?"

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I ran away from home myself, three years ago. I had nowhere\r\n"
"to stay here in Kamurocho, so I would sleep at a burger\r\n"
"joint."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "A burger joint? Sounds uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Sure, but it's open 24 hours, and you can get free coffee\r\n"
"refills. A lot of girls who run away from home hang out there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"A few days ago, a girl in her early twenties started coming\r\n"
" by the burger place that  I go to a lot. I bet she's another runaway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "You think she could be this Nami girl?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "I dunno, but from what you've told me, it's pretty likely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Where's that burger place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"It's called Smile Burger, on Nakamichi Street. You'll know\r\n"
"it when you see it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Got it. Thanks."
msgstr "Capito. Grazie."

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Hey, I was a big help, right? You'll let me order more\r\n"
"food, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Sure. Order whatever you like."
msgstr "Certo. Ordina pure quello che vuoi."

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Then, I'll take the premium salted beef tongue, the premium\r\n"
"wagyu sirloin, annnnd... Oh, today's special, the 2009\r\n"
"Champion Beef Sirloin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "(Argh. She's got my wallet in her vice grip...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "That'll be 20,000 yen for both of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Alright."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "412"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Well, uh... I'm a bit short on cash at the moment..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"What!? Why didn't you say anything!? God, imagine if we'd\r\n"
"gone to a hotel! You'd never live it down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Pay whatever you can, then. I'll cover the rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Sorry about this."
msgstr "Scusa per questo..."

msgctxt "484"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>everything you could<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "520"
msgid "I didn't expect it to be this expensive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Well, of course it is! Information like that doesn't\r\n"
"come cheap! Tee-hee!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "(She's seriously one shrewd woman...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>20,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai pagato <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

